{
  "title": "Quietly Fluffy Turkish Pak Koi Borek",
  "description": "A low-calorie Turkish dish featuring baby pak koi in a fluffy borek, served in a dolsot stone bowl. This fermented dish is perfect for a light lunch.",
  "cuisine": "Turkish",
