      "amount": "1 teaspoon"
    },
    {
      "name": "black pepper",
      "amount": "1/2 teaspoon"
    },
    {
      "name": "dill",
      "amount": "1/4 cup",
      "notes": "chopped fresh"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees.",
    "In a large bowl, mix together the fermented baby pak koi, soffritto, feta cheese, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Layer the phyllo dough in a dolsot stone bowl, brushing each layer with olive oil.",
    "Spoon the pak koi mixture into the center of the phyllo dough, leaving a 1-inch border around the edges.",
    "Fold the phyllo dough over the filling, brushing the edges with olive oil to seal.",
    "Bake the borek for 25 minutes, or until the phyllo dough is golden brown.",
    "Remove the borek from the oven and sprinkle with chopped fresh dill.",
    "Serve the borek hot, straight from the dolsot stone bowl."
  ],
